@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 2 (US 4.1.3 – Search Operation Plans)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "<<container (C4)>>\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nOEM (Backend)" as OEM #87CEEB
participant "<<external>>\nIAM" as IAM #F5F5DC

-> UI: 1: request to search Operation Plans
activate UI
UI -> IAM: 1.1: validate token
activate IAM
IAM --> UI: 1.1.1: token valid
deactivate IAM
UI --> : 1.2: display search form (date range, vessel, sorting)
deactivate UI

-> UI: 2: provide search criteria
activate UI
UI -> OEM: 2.1: GET /api/operationplans?startDate=X&endDate=Y&vvnId=Z&sortBy=S
activate OEM
OEM --> UI: 2.1.1: list of Operation Plans with details
deactivate OEM
UI --> : 2.2: display sortable/filterable table
deactivate UI

@enduml
